WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: de

00:00:00.239 --> 00:00:04.220
The day that everyone warned about

00:00:04.459 --> 00:00:05.500
begins with 

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:07.180
terrifying news:

00:00:08.180 --> 00:00:13.360
China invades Taiwan. Experts have

00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:14.599
already mapped out

00:00:14.599 --> 00:00:15.839
this war scenario.

00:00:16.559 --> 00:00:17.580
They predict an

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:18.800
invasion by China.

00:00:19.639 --> 00:00:21.540
Bombings that destroy Taiwan's navy and

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:22.680
air force.

00:00:24.239 --> 00:00:26.319
Tens of thousands of Chinese soldiers

00:00:26.319 --> 00:00:27.980
crossing the Taiwan Strait.

00:00:28.019 --> 00:00:30.279
China has been threatening has

00:00:30.279 --> 00:00:31.879
annexation for a long time.

00:00:32.639 --> 00:00:33.739
Don't pretend that Taiwan 

00:00:33.739 --> 00:00:35.000
is not part of China.

00:00:35.559 --> 00:00:37.260
I think we can see very clearly that

00:00:37.260 --> 00:00:38.720
states are joining forces to redraw

00:00:38.720 --> 00:00:39.559
the world map.

00:00:39.559 --> 00:00:40.360
 

00:00:41.239 --> 00:00:42.739
It would be a war that seems far away.

00:00:42.739 --> 00:00:45.160
But it would have catastrophic

00:00:45.160 --> 00:00:46.319
consequences for Germany.

00:00:47.540 --> 00:00:48.519
We are vulnerable to blackmail, yes.

00:00:48.940 --> 00:00:51.120
We would have supply shortages and we

00:00:51.120 --> 00:00:52.680
would have mass unemployment.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:54.400
The loss of markets would severely affect

00:00:54.400 --> 00:00:56.459
 both economies.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:58.779
Hardly any other country has made itself so

00:00:58.779 --> 00:01:00.319
dependent on China.

00:01:02.519 --> 00:01:03.660
This is the moment when, from a

00:01:03.660 --> 00:01:04.459
German perspective,

00:01:04.459 --> 00:01:06.000
we need to pause and say,

00:01:06.980 --> 00:01:08.019
Do we really still want it like this?

00:01:09.360 --> 00:01:10.580
Because we are vulnerable.

00:01:11.220 --> 00:01:12.519
How did it get this far?

00:01:13.400 --> 00:01:15.919
We are looking for causes and answers.

00:01:15.919 --> 00:01:20.419
In China, in Germany and in Taiwan.

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:23.000
Is there a way out of this dependency?

00:01:38.919 --> 00:01:40.440
There are many warnings

00:01:40.699 --> 00:01:41.760
that something is going wrong..

00:01:42.699 --> 00:01:44.059
That the dependence on China

00:01:44.059 --> 00:01:46.440
is becoming dangerous for us in Germany..

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:50.480
One warning is the story of 

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:52.080
six-year-old Anton from Berlin.

00:01:53.260 --> 00:01:55.680
And of his doctor Malik Böttcher, who

00:01:55.680 --> 00:01:57.239
has known Anton for a long time.

00:01:57.940 --> 00:01:58.800
He was someone,

00:01:58.800 --> 00:01:59.980
who never really got sick..

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:01.379
And when he had a cold and a fever,

00:02:01.379 --> 00:02:02.239
he still went to

00:02:02.239 --> 00:02:03.120
play in the playground..

00:02:04.279 --> 00:02:05.160
In early May,

00:02:05.160 --> 00:02:06.819
Anton gets a serious infection..

00:02:07.339 --> 00:02:09.279
A television crew is filming in the

00:02:09.279 --> 00:02:11.559
doctor's practice, documenting Anton's visit to the doctor..

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.599
We examined him and saw

00:02:13.599 --> 00:02:15.540
that he had bronchitis on the verge

00:02:15.540 --> 00:02:17.459
to pneumonia.

00:02:17.459 --> 00:02:19.260
And then we decided

00:02:19.260 --> 00:02:20.559
to start antibiotic therapy.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:22.819
And these antibiotics were

00:02:22.819 --> 00:02:24.580
available in the pharmacy..

00:02:25.000 --> 00:02:27.040
But in too small a quantity, in too low a dose.

00:02:27.040 --> 00:02:28.519
.

00:02:29.680 --> 00:02:30.860
It does not take much to mark the difference

00:02:30.860 --> 00:02:32.379
between life or death..

00:02:33.739 --> 00:02:35.360
It can be a small tablet..

00:02:36.620 --> 00:02:37.360
If it is there,

00:02:37.360 --> 00:02:38.319
you don't think about it..

00:02:38.900 --> 00:02:40.660
If it is missing or, as in Anton's case, there's not enough available,

00:02:40.660 --> 00:02:42.639
it becomes dangerous..

00:02:45.760 --> 00:02:46.839
The reason for the shortage.

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:49.040
China is not supplying enough

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:51.540
cephalosporins, i.e. antibiotics, at this time..

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:53.599
And you can't do without China..

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.519
So if the Chinese stop sending us pharmaceuticals

00:02:57.379 --> 00:02:59.819
then we will be short of cephalosporins..

00:02:59.819 --> 00:03:02.279
And especially for severe infections

00:03:02.279 --> 00:03:04.839
cephalosporins are very, very important..

00:03:05.220 --> 00:03:05.779
That means, people

00:03:05.779 --> 00:03:06.639
will die?

00:03:06.639 --> 00:03:07.139
Yes

00:03:08.019 --> 00:03:08.860
There is no one to tell you

00:03:08.860 --> 00:03:09.900
not to worry,.

00:03:11.139 --> 00:03:11.980
antibiotics will soon be available again..

00:03:12.019 --> 00:03:13.580
The shortage becomes the new normal then?.

00:03:15.959 --> 00:03:18.419
In Anton's case, Böttcher tries to avoid

00:03:18.419 --> 00:03:19.980
the dependency on China by treating him

00:03:20.440 --> 00:03:21.559
with a

00:03:21.559 --> 00:03:23.180
lower dose.

00:03:23.839 --> 00:03:24.639
But that doesn't work..

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:27.699
Shortly after these pictures were shot,

00:03:27.699 --> 00:03:29.319
Anton is admitted to hospital

00:03:29.319 --> 00:03:30.519
with severe pneumonia.

00:03:35.739 --> 00:03:38.000
Being dependent on China has

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.180
hardly worried anyone in Germany for a long time..

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.419
The relationship was so unproblematic

00:03:43.419 --> 00:03:44.300
that we never worried

00:03:44.300 --> 00:03:45.160
or would have to worry,

00:03:45.500 --> 00:03:46.220
that this could be turned

00:03:46.220 --> 00:03:47.199
against us..

00:03:47.980 --> 00:03:49.699
Today however, we see that.

00:03:49.919 --> 00:03:50.739
China has changed.

00:03:50.739 --> 00:03:51.680
And that's why we have to change as well..

00:03:53.339 --> 00:03:55.019
How much China has changed

00:03:55.279 --> 00:03:56.779
becomes evident in mid-October at

00:03:56.779 --> 00:03:58.819
Beijing's Silk Road Conference..

00:03:59.860 --> 00:04:01.379
Xi Jinping marches side by side

00:04:01.379 --> 00:04:02.400
with a man

00:04:02.639 --> 00:04:03.959
wanted on an international

00:04:03.959 --> 00:04:05.220
arrest warrant:

00:04:05.800 --> 00:04:06.540
Vladimir Putin..

00:04:07.599 --> 00:04:09.419
For Xi, Putin's brutal war of aggression against

00:04:09.419 --> 00:04:11.360
Ukraine is no reason 

00:04:11.739 --> 00:04:12.580
to distance himself..

00:04:13.019 --> 00:04:13.940
On the contrary..

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.160
All these external factors are

00:04:18.160 --> 00:04:19.419
common threats

00:04:19.419 --> 00:04:20.319
and they strengthen the

00:04:20.319 --> 00:04:22.099
Russian-Chinese cooperation..

00:04:25.000 --> 00:04:26.080
We have to stay outside

00:04:26.080 --> 00:04:28.019
and like almost all western media,&lt;/b

00:04:28.019 --> 00:04:29.379
can watch the opening ceremony only&lt;/b

00:04:29.639 --> 00:04:30.900
on three large screens in the

00:04:30.900 --> 00:04:32.180
press center.

00:04:32.839 --> 00:04:34.879
For Xi, the Silk Road is

00:04:34.879 --> 00:04:35.620
tool to expand

00:04:35.620 --> 00:04:36.000
China's power and influence..

00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:40.120
China promises gifts

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:41.639
and demands allegiance..

00:04:42.540 --> 00:04:43.760
Xi blunbtls threatens anyone

00:04:43.760 --> 00:04:45.440
who evades China's orders..

00:04:46.440 --> 00:04:50.559
Those who see the development of other states as

00:04:50.559 --> 00:04:51.680
a threat and consider

00:04:51.680 --> 00:04:53.160
economic interdependencies

00:04:53.160 --> 00:04:54.860
as a risk

00:04:55.459 --> 00:04:57.860
live no better and do not further

00:04:57.860 --> 00:04:59.339
the development of their countries..

00:05:00.400 --> 00:05:02.980
With Putin, Xi shares a great power fantasy

00:05:02.980 --> 00:05:08.980
which aims at incorporating other countries into their resepctive empires.

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:10.940
What Ukraine is for Putin, Taiwan is for Xi.

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:14.440
Xi's goal is the so called 

00:05:14.440 --> 00:05:16.040
return of Taiwan to the motherland.

00:05:16.419 --> 00:05:17.919
If necessary by force..

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:20.620
A scenario that for many

00:05:20.620 --> 00:05:22.220
seemed as implausible

00:05:22.220 --> 00:05:23.839
like a war in the middle of Europe..

00:05:24.720 --> 00:05:25.839
But ever since Russia

00:05:25.839 --> 00:05:27.160
invaded Ukraine

00:05:27.160 --> 00:05:29.500
a Chinese invasion of Taiwan

00:05:29.500 --> 00:05:30.879
has become a possibility as well..

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:31.860
A war that that go well beyond

00:05:33.599 --> 00:05:35.839
Indo-Pacific region.

00:05:36.779 --> 00:05:39.180
That would drag the USA, Japan and their western allies

00:05:39.180 --> 00:05:41.019
into it..

00:05:41.819 --> 00:05:44.019
And that would call China's allies like

00:05:44.019 --> 00:05:45.860
North Korea and Russia on the plan.

00:05:45.860 --> 00:05:47.260
What we are confronted with here.

00:05:50.260 --> 00:05:52.400
is a world war scenario.

00:05:52.400 --> 00:05:53.599
Russia could be

00:05:53.599 --> 00:05:54.660
seize the moment

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.480
since the Americans would then

00:05:56.480 --> 00:05:57.919
 be bound in the Pacific

00:05:58.160 --> 00:05:59.379
and attack Europe, NATO territory,

00:05:59.400 --> 00:06:01.239
or even

00:06:01.239 --> 00:06:02.440
Germany..

00:06:02.879 --> 00:06:03.620
We could

00:06:03.620 --> 00:06:05.199
find ourselves directly involved in war..

00:06:07.720 --> 00:06:10.319
How serious
China is about

00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:12.559
incorporating Taiwan is evident by 

00:06:13.099 --> 00:06:13.940
its show of force:

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:16.760
Hundreds of fighter jets, bombers, military drones

00:06:16.760 --> 00:06:18.000
and warships of the

00:06:18.000 --> 00:06:19.319
People's Liberation Army

00:06:19.319 --> 00:06:20.580
in the Strait of Taiwan.

00:06:22.440 --> 00:06:24.519
In 2022, experts counted

00:06:24.519 --> 00:06:26.379
1,700 Chinese flights

00:06:26.419 --> 00:06:28.800
crossing into Taiwan's air defense zone..

00:06:29.779 --> 00:06:30.660
This number has already been

00:06:30.660 --> 00:06:31.900
exceeded in this year..

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:35.860
In military drills, China is training its troops for an invasion

00:06:35.860 --> 00:06:37.559
of the democratically governed island

00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:40.779
presenting its efforts on state television

00:06:40.779 --> 00:06:42.760
to its own citizens and the world..

00:06:44.720 --> 00:06:46.540
A demonstration of power..

00:06:47.919 --> 00:06:49.120
We meet Victor Gao,

00:06:49.339 --> 00:06:50.599
Vice President of the Center

00:06:50.599 --> 00:06:52.239
for China in Globalization

00:06:52.239 --> 00:06:53.379
and unofficial mouthpiece

00:06:53.419 --> 00:06:56.199
of the Communist Party, for an interview.

00:06:56.839 --> 00:06:58.980
Is there cause for concern?

00:06:59.199 --> 00:07:02.459
that the Taiwan conflict will escalate soon?&lt;/b

00:07:04.419 --> 00:07:07.800
China's position is very clear.

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:09.160
There is only one China.

00:07:09.480 --> 00:07:10.699
Taiwan is part of China

00:07:10.699 --> 00:07:12.580
and the Government of the People's Republic of China

00:07:12.580 --> 00:07:13.319
is the only

00:07:13.319 --> 00:07:15.139
legitimate representative of China.

00:07:16.000 --> 00:07:16.739
Don't pretend,

00:07:16.739 --> 00:07:18.059
as if you did not know this cornerstone

00:07:18.059 --> 00:07:19.760
of the today's international order.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:20.379
.

00:07:20.419 --> 00:07:22.099
Don't pretend

00:07:22.099 --> 00:07:23.720
that Taiwan is not a part of China..

00:07:27.660 --> 00:07:28.739
Xi Jinping has made

00:07:28.739 --> 00:07:30.220
the so-called reunification

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.239
his top priority..

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:34.459
And China has already singled out

00:07:34.459 --> 00:07:35.800
t he culprits for a possible

00:07:35.800 --> 00:07:37.500
military escalation:.

00:07:38.099 --> 00:07:39.099
You are in

00:07:39.099 --> 00:07:41.199
the USA and Taiwan..

00:07:46.019 --> 00:07:47.040
At Taipei's

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.379
National Revolutionary Martyrs' Shrine,

00:07:48.419 --> 00:07:51.879
people remember the victims of the civil war,

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:53.379
when Communist and

00:07:53.379 --> 00:07:54.860
Republican Chinese

00:07:54.860 --> 00:07:56.419
killed each other..

00:07:57.980 --> 00:07:59.540
Everyone here seems worried,

00:07:59.540 --> 00:08:01.099
that there could soon be even more killings..

00:08:02.339 --> 00:08:04.120
Faced with constant threats

00:08:04.120 --> 00:08:05.860
by an aggressive big brother

00:08:05.860 --> 00:08:07.980
the small democratic

00:08:07.980 --> 00:08:09.839
ssland state massively is massivley arming itself..

00:08:13.279 --> 00:08:14.459
The defense budget

00:08:14.459 --> 00:08:15.360
increases this year alone

00:08:15.419 --> 00:08:18.400
by 14 percent to a new high..

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:20.900
Just now the first

00:08:20.900 --> 00:08:22.819
Taiwan completed its first home built submarine..

00:08:25.760 --> 00:08:26.980
The US has committed to deliver

00:08:26.980 --> 00:08:29.239
F-16 fighter jets..

00:08:30.239 --> 00:08:32.860
Abrams tanks have already been shipped to Taiwan..

00:08:36.839 --> 00:08:38.000
We have an appointment at Taiwan's

00:08:38.000 --> 00:08:39.379
Presidential Palace.

00:08:39.919 --> 00:08:42.019
Wellington Koo, Secretary General of the National Security Council,.

00:08:43.419 --> 00:08:44.440
has the

00:08:44.440 --> 00:08:45.500
challenging task of

00:08:46.260 --> 00:08:47.239
protecting his island against the

00:08:47.239 --> 00:08:49.360
the permanent threat from China..

00:08:50.400 --> 00:08:52.379
China seeks unification with the

00:08:52.379 --> 00:08:53.980
Taiwanese territory

00:08:53.980 --> 00:08:55.160
and makes no secret of it,

00:08:55.160 --> 00:08:56.860
that it would try to achieve that in every conceivable way.

00:08:56.860 --> 00:08:57.900
.

00:08:58.459 --> 00:08:59.699
But the Taiwanese have a

00:08:59.699 --> 00:09:01.099
very deep understanding,

00:09:01.099 --> 00:09:02.540
that dictatorship and democracy

00:09:02.540 --> 00:09:03.739
are compatible with each other..

00:09:05.559 --> 00:09:08.400
Since the republican troops in 1949

00:09:09.400 --> 00:09:11.059
fled from the communists to Taiwan,

00:09:11.540 --> 00:09:13.300
China calls for the return of what it calls

00:09:13.300 --> 00:09:15.040
the renegade island.

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:17.459
93 percent of

00:09:17.459 --> 00:09:18.980
Taiwanese, however, reject this idea..

00:09:19.599 --> 00:09:21.440
Most of them trust that

00:09:21.440 --> 00:09:23.440
their government is doing everything necessary

00:09:23.440 --> 00:09:24.940
to protect them..

00:09:25.720 --> 00:09:27.339
But for some, that's not enough..

00:09:29.940 --> 00:09:31.599
Good afternoon, I am Chuang Yuwei..

00:09:31.879 --> 00:09:33.220
I came back from Ukraine.

00:09:33.220 --> 00:09:34.400
six months ago..

00:09:35.440 --> 00:09:37.379
The 52-year-old is actually a tour guide

00:09:37.419 --> 00:09:41.379
for Japan. But in March 2022,

00:09:41.400 --> 00:09:42.779
he decided that this time

00:09:42.779 --> 00:09:44.760
he would travel to the Ukraine front..

00:09:45.500 --> 00:09:49.440
We want to buy Taiwan some time.

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:51.580
When Ukraine falls

00:09:52.019 --> 00:09:52.919
then maybe our

00:09:52.919 --> 00:09:54.400
Taiwan will be hit next..

00:09:55.360 --> 00:09:57.440
As long as we can help Ukraine

00:09:57.660 --> 00:09:59.540
to fight another minute,

00:10:00.720 --> 00:10:02.419
we will also have one more minute

00:10:02.419 --> 00:10:04.379
of security for Taiwan..

00:10:04.959 --> 00:10:12.300
This is the AK I used to

00:10:12.300 --> 00:10:13.839
fight with in Ukraine..

00:10:14.300 --> 00:10:18.819
In a military club in Taipei,

00:10:18.819 --> 00:10:20.620
Chuang keeps the equipment

00:10:20.620 --> 00:10:22.839
he received as a member of Ukraine's international

00:10:22.839 --> 00:10:25.440
Ukraine's international legion..

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:30.620
The Ukrainian national flag..

00:10:30.620 --> 00:10:31.379
If you survive

00:10:31.379 --> 00:10:36.620
you can take it home as a souvenir. When you die

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:37.940
it is draped over the casket..

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:41.900
One soldier from Taiwan

00:10:41.900 --> 00:10:43.040
has died in Ukraine..

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:45.339
After after eight months of service in Ukraine, however,

00:10:45.339 --> 00:10:47.519
Chuang brought home with him one thing before all others:.

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:48.760
courage.

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:52.239
Before I went to the Ukraine,

00:10:52.239 --> 00:10:53.480
I didn't know

00:10:53.800 --> 00:10:55.900
whether we can resist the Chinese for three days, three

00:10:55.900 --> 00:10:57.180
weeks or three months.

00:10:57.180 --> 00:10:58.379
.

00:10:58.379 --> 00:11:02.440
But after fighting there, I believe that if

00:11:02.440 --> 00:11:04.440
Germany, France, Great Britain

00:11:04.440 --> 00:11:06.239
and the United States are ready

00:11:06.480 --> 00:11:07.980
to support Taiwan with weapons

00:11:08.440 --> 00:11:10.180
the way they support Ukraine,

00:11:10.839 --> 00:11:12.940
then we can beat China..

00:11:17.339 --> 00:11:18.660
There are more souvenirs and

00:11:18.660 --> 00:11:19.959
equipment that

00:11:19.959 --> 00:11:21.019
Chuang brought with him..

00:11:21.940 --> 00:11:23.300
For example, a first aid kit,

00:11:23.300 --> 00:11:24.639
that in his view is superior to Taiwan's.

00:11:24.639 --> 00:11:26.980
.

00:11:31.040 --> 00:11:32.000
Chuang wants to be prepared

00:11:32.000 --> 00:11:33.220
in case Chinese

00:11:33.220 --> 00:11:34.839
would fight Chinese again..

00:11:35.620 --> 00:11:37.599
In the evening he is scheduled to meet others,

00:11:38.220 --> 00:11:39.620
who feel the same way..

00:11:41.839 --> 00:11:42.879
In the autumn sun of

00:11:42.879 --> 00:11:44.480
Munich, that seems a long way away off..

00:11:45.059 --> 00:11:46.419
At Germany's IAA motor show,

00:11:46.419 --> 00:11:47.739
Volkswagen aims to appear

00:11:47.739 --> 00:11:49.980
as majestically as ever..

00:11:51.080 --> 00:11:52.800
But something is different, something

00:11:52.800 --> 00:11:54.379
seems threatening here too..

00:11:55.400 --> 00:11:56.959
Volkswagen's electric cars

00:11:56.959 --> 00:11:58.500
are selling poorly in China,

00:11:58.879 --> 00:12:00.559
the world's most important car market..

