In China, digital functionality

00:12:40.919 --> 00:12:45.379
in the car is very important..

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:49.680
I don't think they believed

00:12:49.680 --> 00:12:51.500
in electromobility at all..

00:12:51.819 --> 00:12:53.379
Volkswagen or GM,

00:12:53.379 --> 00:12:55.620
they were dominating..

