But what we see today is that

00:13:01.160 --> 00:13:02.540
Chinese car manufacturers

00:13:02.879 --> 00:13:06.339
have over 60% market share in electromobility..

00:13:07.220 --> 00:13:09.040
Pieter Nota, at that time

00:13:09.040 --> 00:13:10.519
BMW Board Member for Customer, Brands, and Sales,

00:13:10.760 --> 00:13:11.379
inspects China's e-cars..

00:13:12.400 --> 00:13:15.440
The arrogance of German car managers

00:13:15.440 --> 00:13:16.540
towards Chinese models was legendary.

00:13:16.540 --> 00:13:18.360
.

00:13:19.360 --> 00:13:20.599
Today, car bosses flock in droves

00:13:20.599 --> 00:13:22.400
to study the Chinese. 

00:13:22.400 --> 00:13:23.360
And their own failings.

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:25.559
.

00:13:26.300 --> 00:13:27.680
Including Wolfgang Porsche,

00:13:28.220 --> 00:13:29.720
the powerful VW owner.

00:13:29.720 --> 00:13:31.180
And in tow:

00:13:31.180 --> 00:13:33.680
VW boss Oliver Blume..

00:13:35.260 --> 00:13:36.660
We are still in China the

00:13:36.660 --> 00:13:38.379
strongest automotive company..

00:13:38.419 --> 00:13:41.000
It is crucial for us now,&lt;/b

00:13:41.000 --> 00:13:43.000
that we suceed in the transformation

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:44.220
to electromobility..

00:13:45.019 --> 00:13:46.040
The Chinese say

00:13:46.040 --> 00:13:47.239
German cars are uncool

00:13:47.639 --> 00:13:49.019
I'd rather buy a BYD then.

00:13:49.019 --> 00:13:52.180
So then maybe VW will get, I don't know,

00:13:52.500 --> 00:13:54.040
only 20 or 30 percent of its profits from China..

00:13:54.519 --> 00:13:56.339
That would be a disaster for Wolfsburg, of course..

00:13:57.279 --> 00:13:59.099
In the large exhibition hall in Munich,

00:13:59.099 --> 00:14:00.339
an alarmed

00:14:00.339 --> 00:14:01.699
Germany-AG takes up its positions..

00:14:02.319 --> 00:14:04.239
Chancellor next to car bosses..

00:14:05.639 --> 00:14:07.379
Scholz rushes to Munich,

00:14:07.400 --> 00:14:09.739
rushes to the aid Volkswagen and co.

00:14:10.519 --> 00:14:11.620
The attack from

00:14:11.620 --> 00:14:13.339
China causes something to slip..

00:14:13.699 --> 00:14:15.260
Profits of German brands.

00:14:15.260 --> 00:14:17.339
And with them hundreds of thousands

00:14:17.339 --> 00:14:18.580
of jobs in Germany..

00:14:19.080 --> 00:14:20.199
The mobility turnaround

00:14:20.199 --> 00:14:21.760
is a major task.

00:14:22.000 --> 00:14:23.760
But it's a team effort..

00:14:24.459 --> 00:14:26.000
I'm here to see you today

00:14:26.000 --> 00:14:28.699
as a convinced member of this team..

00:14:29.959 --> 00:14:31.300
The team is fighting against

00:14:31.300 --> 00:14:32.599
a major opponent..

00:14:32.900 --> 00:14:34.639
China's e-cars are cheap

00:14:34.639 --> 00:14:35.379
because Beijing apparently

00:14:35.379 --> 00:14:36.379
subsidizes them unfairly..

00:14:36.400 --> 00:14:39.580
Germany could could fight back

00:14:39.580 --> 00:14:41.099
with Europe-wide punitive tariffs..

00:14:41.559 --> 00:14:42.540
This is the

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:43.839
idea of our China strategy,.

00:14:43.839 --> 00:14:45.019
to create a level playing and to say:

00:14:45.019 --> 00:14:46.220
You protect your markets,

00:14:46.220 --> 00:14:47.339
you make subsidies,

00:14:47.339 --> 00:14:48.440
we then protect our markets,

00:14:48.440 --> 00:14:50.220
from your products. We demand

00:14:50.220 --> 00:14:51.199
equal rights for all..

00:14:51.699 --> 00:14:52.480
We will not be

00:14:52.480 --> 00:14:54.260
pushed out of the playing field..

00:14:54.639 --> 00:14:56.319
Not to use this toolbox

00:14:56.319 --> 00:14:57.319
at a time

00:14:57.319 --> 00:14:58.660
when we can see that the volume

00:14:59.019 --> 00:14:59.919
and price of electric cars pushing into our markets.

00:15:00.419 --> 00:15:02.080
is something that will cause&lt;/b

00:15:03.400 --> 00:15:07.220
a structural shift in these markets,

00:15:07.220 --> 00:15:08.940
that would be madness.&lt;/b

00:15:12.599 --> 00:15:13.660
.

00:15:14.400 --> 00:15:16.000
.

00:15:17.440 --> 00:15:19.139
But will Germany dare?

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:20.940
Will Europe dare

00:15:20.940 --> 00:15:22.400
to engage in a tough conflict with China?&lt;/b

00:15:24.040 --> 00:15:25.860
Suddenly something else happens..

00:15:27.300 --> 00:15:30.940
The party is over,

00:15:31.339 --> 00:15:32.239
announces Greenpeace.

00:15:32.400 --> 00:15:35.500
Bodyguards shield Scholz.

00:15:37.040 --> 00:15:39.419
It's about climate change. But what if

00:15:39.419 --> 00:15:41.639
a completely different party comes to an end here as well?

00:15:42.319 --> 00:15:43.580
An entire industry?

00:15:44.080 --> 00:15:45.779
Germany's economic model?.

00:15:47.779 --> 00:15:48.980
Trade with China,

00:15:49.459 --> 00:15:51.139
has long been a party..

00:15:52.199 --> 00:15:53.559
Angela Merkel called

00:15:53.559 --> 00:15:55.779
Beijing a "strategic partner"..

00:15:56.800 --> 00:15:58.639
The principle: Germany supplies

00:15:58.639 --> 00:16:00.919
engineering, China cheap goods.

00:16:02.120 --> 00:16:04.500
We thought that in an authoritarian state

00:16:04.500 --> 00:16:07.760
there are not the possibilities

00:16:07.760 --> 00:16:09.959
to freedom and creativity as there

00:16:09.959 --> 00:16:11.120
are in democracy.

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.620
That's why we can actually easily

00:16:13.620 --> 00:16:15.000
trade with China,

00:16:15.000 --> 00:16:16.139
because China will always

00:16:16.139 --> 00:16:18.980
try to copy

00:16:19.279 --> 00:16:21.900
what we export there, but they

00:16:21.900 --> 00:16:22.540
will always be one

00:16:22.540 --> 00:16:23.580
one step behind us..

00:16:23.860 --> 00:16:25.379
Because the Chinese are industrious, but

00:16:25.379 --> 00:16:27.059
They obey, they have no ideas..

00:16:27.059 --> 00:16:27.860
That was the cliché?.

00:16:28.059 --> 00:16:28.559
Exactly..

00:16:29.419 --> 00:16:31.379
It was a terrible mistake, because that

00:16:31.379 --> 00:16:32.360
led to

00:16:32.360 --> 00:16:34.239
China catching up and in some

00:16:34.239 --> 00:16:35.559
cases overtaking us./b&gt;cases.

00:16:35.959 --> 00:16:37.779
For Germany's economic bosses,

00:16:37.779 --> 00:16:38.760
trade with China was a

00:16:38.760 --> 00:16:40.540
highly profitable gift..

00:16:41.139 --> 00:16:43.379
Now it is becoming a a danger, because China

00:16:43.379 --> 00:16:45.199
has caught up, in some

00:16:45.199 --> 00:16:46.980
areas overtaken.areas.

00:16:47.760 --> 00:16:49.220
We have reached a point where

00:16:49.220 --> 00:16:49.779
you notice that

00:16:49.779 --> 00:16:51.019
the balance is shifting.

00:16:51.019 --> 00:16:53.220
Imports from China are increasing, our

00:16:53.220 --> 00:16:55.000
exports to China are on the decline..

00:16:55.680 --> 00:16:56.779
The economic balance

00:16:56.779 --> 00:16:57.980
ia shifting towards China..

00:16:58.419 --> 00:16:59.599
And this is the moment when, from a German

00:16:59.599 --> 00:17:01.319
perspective, we have to pause

00:17:01.319 --> 00:17:03.160
and say:

00:17:03.160 --> 00:17:04.139
Do we really want it this way?

00:17:04.139 --> 00:17:04.540
The German

00:17:04.540 --> 00:17:06.160
business model is finished.

00:17:06.580 --> 00:17:08.000
And from your point of view, what is that based on?

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.000
Well, it is basedon the fact 

00:17:10.000 --> 00:17:12.099
tht we import cheap primary products from China,&lt;/b

00:17:12.400 --> 00:17:16.019
cheap gas from Russia, do business

00:17:16.019 --> 00:17:17.540
all over the world

00:17:17.540 --> 00:17:18.339
and the Americans are 

00:17:18.339 --> 00:17:19.440
paying for our security..

00:17:20.059 --> 00:17:22.319
So, that's definitely over now..

00:17:23.839 --> 00:17:25.160
Corona and Russia`s war against Ukraine

00:17:25.160 --> 00:17:26.819
have shown us, how dependent we are&lt;/b

00:17:26.819 --> 00:17:28.919
global supply chains.

00:17:28.919 --> 00:17:30.760
.

00:17:31.839 --> 00:17:34.160
But our dependence on China is

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:35.680
actually even greater.

00:17:36.699 --> 00:17:38.599
Responsible for Germany's trade is the

00:17:38.599 --> 00:17:39.779
Federal Minister of Economics..

00:17:40.519 --> 00:17:42.800
What lessons has Robert Habeck learned?

00:17:43.919 --> 00:17:46.879
We had 55% gas dependency and we

00:17:46.879 --> 00:17:48.819
just about made it

00:17:49.400 --> 00:17:51.019
to keep the national economy running.

00:17:51.019 --> 00:17:53.419
90 would not have been possible..

00:17:53.779 --> 00:17:55.080
We were able to.

00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:57.760
replace 55% with high

00:17:57.760 --> 00:17:59.120
inflation, with high prices,&lt;/b

00:17:59.519 --> 00:18:00.120
and a deep

00:18:00.120 --> 00:18:01.879
economic crisis,&lt;/b

00:18:01.879 --> 00:18:03.760
with a period of weakness that

00:18:03.760 --> 00:18:05.239
lasted the whole year..

00:18:05.639 --> 00:18:07.580
90% would have pulled our feet from under us..

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:10.699
90% that's how 

00:18:10.699 --> 00:18:12.500
dependendant we are from China, for

00:18:12.500 --> 00:18:12.980
some

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:15.040
medicines or rare earths..

00:18:15.559 --> 00:18:16.160
If there is a

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:18.160
confrontation with Taiwan

00:18:18.680 --> 00:18:20.220
then the relationships between

00:18:20.220 --> 00:18:21.180
Germany and China

00:18:21.180 --> 00:18:22.419
will change completely overnight..

00:18:24.000 --> 00:18:25.760
A war of aggression would

00:18:25.760 --> 00:18:27.680
result in sanctions against China..

00:18:28.339 --> 00:18:29.819
And the

00:18:29.819 --> 00:18:32.120
world's most important trade route would disrupted.

00:18:32.879 --> 00:18:35.300
Direct trade with China alone

00:18:35.300 --> 00:18:36.279
would probably cost us

00:18:36.279 --> 00:18:38.080
1 million jobs,

00:18:38.080 --> 00:18:39.120
if we had to cut ties overnight.

00:18:39.120 --> 00:18:40.800
.

00:18:41.080 --> 00:18:42.180
But that's not all..

00:18:42.819 --> 00:18:45.339
Through the Taiwan Strait

00:18:45.339 --> 00:18:46.699
between a third to

00:18:46.699 --> 00:18:47.379
one half of the global trade in goods

00:18:47.400 --> 00:18:49.739
is being shipped.

00:18:49.739 --> 00:18:51.440
None of that

00:18:51.440 --> 00:18:52.199
would arrive..

00:18:52.400 --> 00:18:54.519
That means we would have supply bottlenecks

00:18:54.519 --> 00:18:56.180
and we would have mass unemployment..

00:18:56.580 --> 00:18:58.300
Nobody really wants to imagine that..

00:18:58.860 --> 00:19:00.839
The federal government has now issued a

00:19:00.839 --> 00:19:02.319
China strategy..

00:19:03.160 --> 00:19:05.019
The goal is called de-risking..

00:19:05.519 --> 00:19:06.900
Less China risk,

00:19:07.440 --> 00:19:09.059
less China naivety..

00:19:10.019 --> 00:19:11.220
But what does that mean?

00:19:11.839 --> 00:19:13.040
How could it work?

00:19:16.279 --> 00:19:18.540
Taiwan thought early on about how

00:19:18.540 --> 00:19:19.900
it can hedge its bets..

00:19:20.879 --> 00:19:23.099
His ace is the semiconductor industry..

00:19:24.639 --> 00:19:26.519
One of the most valuable companies in the

00:19:26.519 --> 00:19:30.400
world, TSMC, is located in Taiwan..

00:19:33.819 --> 00:19:36.099
 

00:19:36.099 --> 00:19:36.599
 

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:40.720
If Taiwan's foreign trade were interrupted,&lt;/b

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:43.160
then that would be a major disaster.

00:19:43.599 --> 00:19:44.699
not just for Taiwan,

00:19:44.919 --> 00:19:46.199
but for the whole world..

00:19:46.519 --> 00:19:48.940
Because Taiwan represents 60 percent of the

00:19:48.940 --> 00:19:51.319
worldwide production of semiconductors..

00:19:57.400 --> 00:20:00.480
TSMC, the Taiwan Semiconductor

00:20:00.480 --> 00:20:01.800
Manufacturing Company,

00:20:02.419 --> 00:20:03.819
has dedicated a museum to semiconductors,

00:20:03.819 --> 00:20:05.400
its successful product..

00:20:07.599 --> 00:20:09.080
The tiny chips are in

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:10.639
Refrigerators, cars and

00:20:10.639 --> 00:20:12.379
mobile phones all over the world..

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:15.160
The success of an industrial policy that

00:20:15.160 --> 00:20:17.019
has beend pursued for decades..

00:20:19.059 --> 00:20:21.260
In the past, TSMC, like

00:20:21.260 --> 00:20:23.160
everyone else, focused om costs

00:20:23.160 --> 00:20:25.199
and invested heavily in China..

00:20:26.000 --> 00:20:27.900
But they started earlier than we did

00:20:27.900 --> 00:20:31.059
to rethink and focus on de-risking..

00:20:35.120 --> 00:20:37.279
The mainland has increasingly

00:20:37.279 --> 00:20:38.739
emerged as our competitor..

00:20:39.220 --> 00:20:40.800
As a result, Taiwan's

00:20:40.800 --> 00:20:42.580
investments in mainland China

00:20:42.580 --> 00:20:44.339
in the last 14 years

00:20:44.339 --> 00:20:45.620
has gone down gradually./b&gt;.

00:20:46.019 --> 00:20:48.459
In 2020, even the last

00:20:48.459 --> 00:20:50.379
Taiwanese companies have understood

00:20:50.919 --> 00:20:53.239
that production costs are no longer the

00:20:53.239 --> 00:20:54.199
most important factor

00:20:54.199 --> 00:20:55.279
for a company's business

00:20:55.639 --> 00:20:57.720
but that they need to take geopolitical considerations

00:20:57.720 --> 00:20:59.459
and risk diversification

00:20:59.459 --> 00:21:00.400
into account..

00:21:02.400 --> 00:21:06.019
The TSMC museum commemorates the Seven

00:21:06.019 --> 00:21:08.459
Fathers of Taiwan's electrical industry.

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:10.879
Managers and government officials who

00:21:10.879 --> 00:21:12.379
almost 50 years ago

00:21:12.379 --> 00:21:13.080
sat down in

00:21:13.080 --> 00:21:15.040
a soy milk snack shack

00:21:15.040 --> 00:21:15.860
and made a

00:21:15.860 --> 00:21:17.800
far-ranging decision..

00:21:19.279 --> 00:21:20.080
Kristi Xu is an

00:21:20.080 --> 00:21:21.319
economist..

00:21:21.819 --> 00:21:23.720
She knows TSMC inside out..

00:21:24.540 --> 00:21:26.480
She takes us to a soy milk bar, where we choose between

00:21:26.480 --> 00:21:28.019
soy milk, warm or

00:21:28.019 --> 00:21:29.379
cold, sweet or salty..

00:21:29.400 --> 00:21:32.900
proteins that the founding fathers of the

00:21:32.900 --> 00:21:33.540
Taiwanese

00:21:33.540 --> 00:21:35.819
electrical industry.

00:21:36.699 --> 00:21:37.199
might have consumed as well.

00:21:38.839 --> 00:21:44.379
They decided that we should

00:21:44.379 --> 00:21:45.580
concentrate our expertise on one product.

00:21:47.019 --> 00:21:49.040
And that we should develop something

00:21:49.279 --> 00:21:50.860
that could not simply be copied

00:21:50.860 --> 00:21:52.360
by our neighboring countries..

00:21:52.400 --> 00:21:57.800
The plan received government

00:21:57.800 --> 00:21:59.639
support and was a complete sucess..

00:22:00.260 --> 00:22:01.779
Today, the whole world depends

00:22:01.779 --> 00:22:03.599
on Taiwan's semiconductors..

00:22:03.980 --> 00:22:05.199
The production process is

00:22:05.199 --> 00:22:07.099
uniquely sophisticated..

00:22:07.800 --> 00:22:15.059
It's very ironic, but even if

00:22:15.059 --> 00:22:17.379
the Chinese were to conquer TSMC,

00:22:17.379 --> 00:22:26.800
they would only get the factory, the building. Because the people have legs and most of the engineers have a green card. 

00:22:27.160 --> 00:22:30.139
They can just go to the USA. What TSMC is at its core would no

00:22:30.139 --> 00:22:31.300
longer work.

00:22:31.739 --> 00:22:37.400
Neither China nor the rest of

00:22:37.400 --> 00:22:38.860
the world can afford it

00:22:38.860 --> 00:22:39.739
if the supply of semicunductors fails.

00:22:39.739 --> 00:22:41.019
.

00:22:41.779 --> 00:22:43.379
So China will think twice before really attacking Taiwan

00:22:43.379 --> 00:22:45.980
 

00:22:46.400 --> 00:22:47.400
And the international

00:22:47.400 --> 00:22:48.980
Community will try everything

00:22:49.440 --> 00:22:51.660
to prevent a war over Taiwan..

00:22:52.379 --> 00:22:53.160
And not only that.

00:22:54.400 --> 00:22:55.959
Taiwan's strategy has far-reaching

00:22:55.959 --> 00:22:58.059
implications on global trade

00:22:58.400 --> 00:23:01.400
and onEurope, says Mathieu Duchâtel,

00:23:02.059 --> 00:23:04.540
one of the leading Taiwan experts..

00:23:05.160 --> 00:23:08.000
I think that is

00:23:08.000 --> 00:23:09.559
practiced de-risking,

00:23:10.400 --> 00:23:11.459
i.e. risk minimization by Taiwan..

00:23:11.900 --> 00:23:12.660
That does not mean that

00:23:12.660 --> 00:23:14.260
globalization is completely dead..

00:23:14.639 --> 00:23:15.860
I think we are dealing with

00:23:15.860 --> 00:23:18.120
a certain degree of de-globalization,.

00:23:18.500 --> 00:23:20.019
but we remain in the world of

00:23:20.019 --> 00:23:21.440
inter-dependencies,

00:23:21.959 --> 00:23:23.639
of linking supply chains.

00:23:23.860 --> 00:23:24.360
That remains..

00:23:24.699 --> 00:23:25.559
But there are more

00:23:25.559 --> 00:23:26.879
and more exeptions to this rule..

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:33.440
Taiwan has a silicon shield,

00:23:33.440 --> 00:23:35.160
.

00:23:36.040 --> 00:23:36.739
a protective shield

00:23:39.559 --> 00:23:41.800
made of semiconductors..

00:23:47.680 --> 00:23:48.279
And Germany?

00:23:49.419 --> 00:23:49.860
It is precisely this

00:23:49.860 --> 00:23:51.860
protective shield against China that it is missing..

00:23:53.819 --> 00:23:54.940
There is no protective shield

00:23:54.940 --> 00:23:56.319
for the medicines that Anton urgently needs.

00:23:58.040 --> 00:23:59.180
No alternative to

00:23:59.180 --> 00:24:00.739
the missing antibiotics..

00:24:02.660 --> 00:24:04.139
The treatment for Anton is not working..

00:24:05.019 --> 00:24:06.379
With a severe pneumonia,

00:24:06.400 --> 00:24:08.379
Anton's parents have to take him

00:24:08.379 --> 00:24:09.599
to hospital..

00:24:11.819 --> 00:24:14.099
His oxygen levels were very low..

00:24:14.480 --> 00:24:16.760
Anton was actually in a very bad condition..

00:24:16.760 --> 00:24:17.239
He had trouble

00:24:17.239 --> 00:24:18.160
breathing, trouble walking..

00:24:18.839 --> 00:24:20.599
He didn't feel like doing anything because he

00:24:20.599 --> 00:24:21.559
simply lacked all strength..

00:24:24.400 --> 00:24:25.440
If you don't get antibiotics

00:24:25.440 --> 00:24:27.080
it's just bad..

00:24:27.879 --> 00:24:30.339
It is very painful as a parent,

00:24:30.339 --> 00:24:31.260
because you can't help your child.

00:24:31.260 --> 00:24:32.379
Because there is nothing there to help with..

00:24:32.400 --> 00:24:33.040
Yet antibiotics were produced in Germany for decades.

00:24:37.559 --> 00:24:39.000
.

00:24:40.220 --> 00:24:43.220
Penicillin was produced in

00:24:43.220 --> 00:24:44.739
Frankfurt-Höchst from 1950 onwards.

00:24:46.940 --> 00:24:48.559
So much that after just a few years

00:24:49.139 --> 00:24:51.099
tall of Germany 

00:24:51.099 --> 00:24:52.239
could be supplied..

00:24:53.220 --> 00:24:54.959
This medicine will save the lives of countless Germans

00:24:54.959 --> 00:24:55.919
in the years to come.

00:24:55.919 --> 00:24:58.319
It is very difficult to imagine..

00:24:58.699 --> 00:24:59.379
If you think about how much penicillin

00:24:59.400 --> 00:25:01.720
and cephalosporins

00:25:01.720 --> 00:25:03.260
were manufactured at Höchst.

00:25:03.919 --> 00:25:05.519
after the Second World War and

00:25:05.519 --> 00:25:07.139
into this millennium..

00:25:07.720 --> 00:25:08.500
And at some point

00:25:08.500 --> 00:25:09.660
the Chinese thought

00:25:09.860 --> 00:25:11.400
we don't like that.

00:25:11.400 --> 00:25:12.239
We want the

00:25:12.239 --> 00:25:13.779
market to be dependent on us..

00:25:14.400 --> 00:25:16.419
And they flooded the market with dumping prices

00:25:16.419 --> 00:25:19.199
for their starting materials..

00:25:19.199 --> 00:25:20.680
That means: The Chinese have made sure that.

00:25:20.879 --> 00:25:23.379
due to dumping prices the production

00:25:23.379 --> 00:25:24.739
at Höchst had to close down? Yes.

00:25:26.379 --> 00:25:27.379
The Höchst building is now an industrial monument..

00:25:27.419 --> 00:25:31.360
Since 2017

00:25:31.360 --> 00:25:32.879
there is no more any antibiotics production.

00:25:33.400 --> 00:25:34.160
Because everyone was only looking

00:25:34.160 --> 00:25:35.180
at the price..

00:25:35.660 --> 00:25:37.419
With hindsight,&lt;/b

00:25:37.419 --> 00:25:38.739
you can certainly say it was a strategic mistake, but

00:25:38.739 --> 00:25:41.120
at the same time it was simply cheaper

00:25:41.599 --> 00:25:43.080
to produce in China..

00:25:43.080 --> 00:25:43.760
You have to 

00:25:43.760 --> 00:25:45.180
ask our insurance companies,

00:25:45.180 --> 00:25:47.199
are you willing to pay

00:25:47.199 --> 00:25:49.019
Dmore for medication

00:25:49.019 --> 00:25:50.459
because we have produced it in Europe or in India

00:25:50.459 --> 00:25:53.279
or in America?

00:25:53.279 --> 00:25:55.379
In essence, the price pressure from insurance companies&lt;/b

00:25:55.500 --> 00:25:59.819
and consumers has led to

00:25:59.819 --> 00:26:02.500
all these difficult

00:26:02.500 --> 00:26:04.040
product categories

00:26:04.040 --> 00:26:05.059
migrating to China..

00:26:06.319 --> 00:26:07.459
Just how dependent

00:26:07.459 --> 00:26:09.339
Germany has become on China,

00:26:09.819 --> 00:26:12.220
became clear the year before at the latest..

00:26:15.279 --> 00:26:19.680
In October 2016, a boiler explodes in an

00:26:19.680 --> 00:26:20.379
antibiotics factory in eastern China.

00:26:20.379 --> 00:26:22.739
 

00:26:24.400 --> 00:26:27.940
We heard a loud bang

00:26:27.940 --> 00:26:29.199
and we all ran outside..

00:26:29.800 --> 00:26:31.080
When I came out, the

00:26:31.080 --> 00:26:32.199
street was full of people..

00:26:32.779 --> 00:26:33.959
We saw flames several meters high..

00:26:37.599 --> 00:26:39.500
The company Qilu produces the antibiotic

00:26:39.500 --> 00:26:41.559
piperacillin here..

00:26:42.400 --> 00:26:43.639
In Germany, there is an immediate

00:26:43.639 --> 00:26:45.239
supply shortage

00:26:45.239 --> 00:26:47.379
for products containing piperacillin..

00:26:48.559 --> 00:26:49.639
Thanks to its dumping prices, China has mangaged to make sure

00:26:51.360 --> 00:26:53.400
that certain antibiotics are now only produced

00:26:53.400 --> 00:26:54.639
in China..

00:26:55.459 --> 00:26:57.760
Cephalosporins, for example, are now only produced in

00:26:57.760 --> 00:26:59.540
three large factories..

00:27:01.419 --> 00:27:02.599
We write to the companies.

00:27:03.400 --> 00:27:05.279
Almost always they answer: No interview!

00:27:08.099 --> 00:27:10.660
Or we are suspected of espionage

00:27:10.660 --> 00:27:12.519
A popular formulation to avoid annoying

00:27:12.519 --> 00:27:14.080
questions from journalists. 

00:27:15.040 --> 00:27:16.819
Foreigners are infiltrating China badly.

00:27:17.099 --> 00:27:18.139
The whole country is fighting

00:27:18.139 --> 00:27:19.319
spies now..

00:27:19.860 --> 00:27:21.860
They can't talk about political topics.

00:27:21.860 --> 00:27:23.559
Too sensitive..

00:27:26.739 --> 00:27:28.099
At Qilu, China's

00:27:28.099 --> 00:27:29.620
large antibiotics company,

00:27:29.839 --> 00:27:31.440
the press office sounds like this:

00:27:33.220 --> 00:27:36.519
We have no interest in

00:27:36.519 --> 00:27:38.199
working with foreign media..

00:27:38.639 --> 00:27:40.639
We do not do any external communication

00:27:40.639 --> 00:27:41.819
via foreign media. Goodbye!

00:27:45.239 --> 00:27:47.080
We travel to one of the

00:27:47.080 --> 00:27:48.400
cephalosporine plants

00:27:48.400 --> 00:27:50.239
in Shanxi province..

00:27:50.800 --> 00:27:51.900
Qilu's exports to

00:27:51.900 --> 00:27:53.540
Europe last year increased

00:27:53.540 --> 00:27:56.620
by 130 %..

00:27:59.180 --> 00:28:00.080
At the main entrance of the

00:28:00.080 --> 00:28:01.739
antibiotics factory one employee,

00:28:02.120 --> 00:28:02.739
agress to

00:28:02.739 --> 00:28:04.139
talk to us..

00:28:04.699 --> 00:28:07.120
We produce cephalosporins..

00:28:07.660 --> 00:28:09.319
Our products go all over the world..

00:28:10.000 --> 00:28:11.379
I'm really proud of that!.

00:28:14.400 --> 00:28:15.980
Our presence has

00:28:15.980 --> 00:28:17.260
not gone unnoticed..

00:28:17.720 --> 00:28:18.680
Discussion with

00:28:18.680 --> 00:28:20.139
security staff at the main entrance..

00:28:21.080 --> 00:28:22.040
Filming prohibited..

00:28:23.400 --> 00:28:25.620
China tries to make others dependent on itself.

00:28:25.620 --> 00:28:27.239
And China autonomous..

00:28:28.160 --> 00:28:29.919
De-risking with Chinese characteristics even

00:28:29.919 --> 00:28:30.860
has its own name:.

00:28:31.660 --> 00:28:33.440
The system of dual circulation..

00:28:33.800 --> 00:28:36.220
It means: To prepare itself for trade war,

00:28:36.440 --> 00:28:37.599
China wants to boost domestic consumption

00:28:40.400 --> 00:28:42.400
and reduce its dependence
from exports..

00:28:46.940 --> 00:28:49.580
Isn't de-risking exactly what

00:28:49.580 --> 00:28:50.680
China for many

00:28:50.680 --> 00:28:51.940
years has been practicing itself?

00:28:52.440 --> 00:28:54.760
In other words, making itself more independent.

00:28:55.019 --> 00:28:55.900
Isolating itself from foreign influences?

00:28:57.120 --> 00:28:58.760
Isn't that the same strategy?

00:29:00.059 --> 00:29:04.220
No, I don't think so..

00:29:04.580 --> 00:29:06.720
Since 1978,

00:29:06.720 --> 00:29:07.860
China has opened up to the world

00:29:07.860 --> 00:29:08.379
and reformed its politics and economy..

00:29:08.400 --> 00:29:11.500
China sees itself as

00:29:11.500 --> 00:29:13.160
indispensable part of the world..

00:29:13.540 --> 00:29:14.739
It wanted to embrace the world..

00:29:18.400 --> 00:29:22.019
But if a country

00:29:22.019 --> 00:29:24.040
wants to exert maximum pressure on China,&lt;/b

00:29:24.279 --> 00:29:24.980
if it wants to de-couple,

00:29:25.379 --> 00:29:26.860
if it wants to deny China access to

00:29:26.860 --> 00:29:28.540
high technologies,

00:29:28.900 --> 00:29:30.900
then China must do the right thing..

00:29:31.800 --> 00:29:33.379
So invest heavily to mobilize all talents,.

00:29:33.660 --> 00:29:40.760
it must to become self-reliant..

00:29:41.260 --> 00:29:43.180
That is not what China wanted in the beginning.

00:29:43.959 --> 00:29:46.400
That's what the wrong policies of other countries

00:29:46.400 --> 00:29:47.839
have forced us to do..

00:29:48.220 --> 00:29:50.440
China has no other choice.

00:29:53.680 --> 00:29:56.680
German corporations

00:29:56.680 --> 00:29:58.440
on the other hand, risk even more..

00:29:58.819 --> 00:30:00.139
Their China investments

00:30:00.139 --> 00:30:01.379
have risen significantly..

00:30:01.379 --> 00:30:06.639
I believe that there are still some in the economy who say that we are simply looking

00:30:06.639 --> 00:30:07.739
to make optimal profits with China..

00:30:08.580 --> 00:30:10.139
But that they are not also

00:30:10.139 --> 00:30:11.319
minimizing risks..

00:30:12.120 --> 00:30:13.839
For fear of being left behind,

00:30:13.839 --> 00:30:16.440
Volkswagen invests 2.5 billion euros in

00:30:16.440 --> 00:30:18.300
a project with Horizon Robotics..

00:30:18.919 --> 00:30:20.319
The Chinese are the leaders in

00:30:20.319 --> 00:30:21.760
self-driving cars..

00:30:22.680 --> 00:30:23.580
We want to give the customer the

00:30:23.580 --> 00:30:24.620
the best there is..

00:30:25.019 --> 00:30:26.199
And then we just take the best

00:30:26.199 --> 00:30:27.639
solutions available in the regions..

00:30:27.940 --> 00:30:28.419
It's an expensive bet on the future..

00:30:28.419 --> 00:30:32.040
On the fact that profit in China

00:30:32.040 --> 00:30:34.379
works like a VW Beetle used to:.

00:30:34.760 --> 00:30:36.980
It runs and runs and runs..

00:30:37.699 --> 00:30:39.519
It could be a fallacy.

00:30:39.839 --> 00:30:40.720
We will have to

00:30:40.720 --> 00:30:42.180
replace the Chinese market,&lt;/b

00:30:42.739 --> 00:30:43.500
because, in the long term, our

00:30:43.500 --> 00:30:45.019
companies will no longer play

00:30:45.019 --> 00:30:46.360
the role

00:30:47.120 --> 00:30:48.000
they have played in the last 10,

00:30:48.000 --> 00:30:49.099
20 years..

00:30:50.900 --> 00:30:52.760
But in the wake of the big players,

00:30:52.760 --> 00:30:54.379
the smaller ones are carrying on as before as well..

00:30:54.400 --> 00:30:57.540
Supplier companies like the 

00:30:57.540 --> 00:30:59.500
Neue Zahnradwerk Leipzig GmbH

00:30:59.500 --> 00:31:01.379
with a about 1000 employees..

00:31:03.260 --> 00:31:05.080
Hubertus Bartsch built up the company

00:31:05.080 --> 00:31:06.940
over 20 years ago..

00:31:07.779 --> 00:31:09.019
Eight years ago,

00:31:09.019 --> 00:31:10.180
a factory in China was added.

00:31:11.260 --> 00:31:13.300
Volkswagen's sales problems in China

00:31:13.300 --> 00:31:15.540
are also affecting him..

00:31:15.860 --> 00:31:17.900
The best times are when my brain is not

00:31:17.900 --> 00:31:19.239
working at night.

00:31:19.879 --> 00:31:20.879
But you can believe me,

00:31:21.540 --> 00:31:22.379
that I have relatively rarely slept in recent years..

00:31:22.419 --> 00:31:23.940
Also this year..

00:31:29.879 --> 00:31:31.959
His company traditionally produces motor-

00:31:31.959 --> 00:31:33.239
and transmission parts

00:31:33.239 --> 00:31:34.000
for combustion engines..

00:31:34.559 --> 00:31:35.779
But now e-cars are

00:31:35.779 --> 00:31:37.540
important, especially in China..

00:31:38.519 --> 00:31:39.440
And the question is:

00:31:39.440 --> 00:31:41.000
Can Bartsch manage the transition?

00:31:41.540 --> 00:31:42.360
And what will happen to

00:31:42.360 --> 00:31:43.480
his most important customer?

00:31:43.919 --> 00:31:44.419
To Volkswagen?

00:31:45.239 --> 00:31:45.919
Will the Group

00:31:45.919 --> 00:31:47.519
continue to order more from Bartsch,

00:31:47.519 --> 00:31:49.379
even if things get tight for VW itself?

00:31:50.800 --> 00:31:51.819
SMEs in particular

00:31:51.819 --> 00:31:53.199
in the automotive supply chain

00:31:53.199 --> 00:31:55.199
are currently under extreme pressure..

00:31:55.199 --> 00:31:57.080
Moving away from the combustion engine to the electric car..

00:31:58.279 --> 00:31:58.940
And some will certainly

00:31:58.940 --> 00:32:00.059
fall through the cracks..

00:32:01.419 --> 00:32:03.540
At the moment, Bartsch has the feeling&lt;/b

00:32:03.540 --> 00:32:05.220
that he has got away with it once again..

00:32:06.459 --> 00:32:08.300
During the pandemic, he only saw his Chinese

00:32:08.300 --> 00:32:10.019
colleagues on the screen..

00:32:11.480 --> 00:32:12.919
Now, for the first time, he returns

00:32:12.919 --> 00:32:14.059
once again to Tianjin..

00:32:15.040 --> 00:32:15.639
He is nervous..

00:32:16.580 --> 00:32:17.739
.
What will await him there?

00:32:18.459 --> 00:32:22.760
In 2015, we have accompanied

00:32:22.760 --> 00:32:23.860
Bartsch once before..

00:32:24.839 --> 00:32:27.720
The China factory, built for around 50 million

00:32:27.959 --> 00:32:29.900
Euro, was brand new at the time..

00:32:31.279 --> 00:32:32.580
From Bartsch' shirt pocket

00:32:32.580 --> 00:32:33.919
his passport was visible..

00:32:34.319 --> 00:32:36.459
He was constantly commuting between two worlds..

00:32:36.900 --> 00:32:39.239
It was the time of the China euphoria..

00:32:41.800 --> 00:32:43.379
We belong to a few private investors..

00:32:43.400 --> 00:32:47.459
This is not just a matter of the heart,

00:32:47.459 --> 00:32:49.239
it is also a part of our existence..

00:32:49.900 --> 00:32:51.919
That means you need to suceed in China?

00:32:52.680 --> 00:32:53.919
Yes, we will suceed..

00:32:55.760 --> 00:32:57.040
Bartsch has been producing here for

00:32:57.040 --> 00:32:58.519
eight years now..

00:32:59.239 --> 00:33:01.160
No passport is peeking out of his shirt anymore..

00:33:01.739 --> 00:33:03.620
It seems like China is farther away today

00:33:03.620 --> 00:33:04.800
than back then..

00:33:05.319 --> 00:33:06.599
If only because of Corona..

00:33:08.739 --> 00:33:10.580
It was a long and exhausting time..

00:33:10.879 --> 00:33:11.379
I am very surprised,

00:33:11.419 --> 00:33:13.720
that we are in such

00:33:13.720 --> 00:33:15.500
good shape at the moment..

00:33:16.220 --> 00:33:19.120
That the employees, the whole team

00:33:19.300 --> 00:33:21.519
over the years

00:33:21.519 --> 00:33:23.900
have kept this business running alone..

00:33:25.260 --> 00:33:26.419
The pandemic could be a

00:33:26.419 --> 00:33:28.319
warning about dependencies..

00:33:28.699 --> 00:33:30.120
What it's like to suddenly

00:33:30.120 --> 00:33:32.220
be cut off from supply chains.

00:33:32.559 --> 00:33:35.040
and your own multi-million investments..

00:33:37.220 --> 00:33:45.699
My assessment is that German companies,&lt;/b
who operate in China must know that their investments there

00:33:45.699 --> 00:33:47.760
maybe treated completely

00:33:47.760 --> 00:33:48.660
different

00:33:48.660 --> 00:33:51.419
than in constitutional states like in Europe..

00:33:51.819 --> 00:33:52.839
That they could be expropriated?

00:33:53.080 --> 00:33:55.279
Well, that is is certainly not

00:33:55.279 --> 00:33:56.599
only a theoretical possibility..

00:33:57.819 --> 00:34:00.260
Bartsch, however, does not want to minimize risks&lt;/b

00:34:00.680 --> 00:34:02.940
de-risk..

00:34:03.760 --> 00:34:05.379
There is also de-industrialization..

00:34:05.379 --> 00:34:09.260
Everything that starts with "D" goes downhill..

00:34:09.779 --> 00:34:12.000
We are very strongly organized in China.

00:34:12.279 --> 00:34:13.800
But the bottom line

00:34:13.800 --> 00:34:14.800
for our company

00:34:14.800 --> 00:34:15.819
is that we

00:34:16.139 --> 00:34:18.720
have to make sure

00:34:18.720 --> 00:34:20.440
that our risk in China.

00:34:22.339 --> 00:34:27.620
reimains acceptable.

00:34:27.819 --> 00:34:29.819
They are working on this all over Taiwan.

00:34:30.699 --> 00:34:32.379
The head of the GEOSAT company

00:34:32.379 --> 00:34:38.639
focuses on deterrence and armor. Lo Chen-Fang produces civilian

00:34:38.639 --> 00:34:41.099
and also increasingly military drones,

00:34:41.540 --> 00:34:43.099
because Taiwan is upgrading.

00:34:43.779 --> 00:34:46.019
It has to, says the flight engineer.

00:34:48.199 --> 00:34:49.620
Fujian in South China,

00:34:49.620 --> 00:34:50.680
where the Chinese have

00:34:50.680 --> 00:34:52.319
deployed their missiles,

00:34:52.839 --> 00:34:55.220
is only two hours away by plane.

00:34:55.220 --> 00:34:57.379
Since the visit of the Speaker of the US House of Representatives

00:34:57.540 --> 00:35:03.540
Pelosi last year

00:35:03.540 --> 00:35:05.199
China's missile positions

00:35:05.199 --> 00:35:06.339
have moved to the front.

00:35:06.760 --> 00:35:07.779
So far, they have only been able

00:35:07.779 --> 00:35:09.540
to reach the eastern part of Taiwan.

00:35:09.879 --> 00:35:10.940
But now their range

00:35:10.940 --> 00:35:12.959
covers every square centimeter

00:35:12.959 --> 00:35:15.099
of Taiwan's territory.

00:35:16.419 --> 00:35:22.180
To test their machines 

00:35:22.180 --> 00:35:23.459
in battle,

00:35:23.940 --> 00:35:24.860
there has been.

00:35:24.860 --> 00:35:27.800
a sad test field.
since February 2022.

00:35:28.040 --> 00:35:28.860
The Ukraine.

00:35:29.819 --> 00:35:32.239
One of GEOSAT's helicopter drones

00:35:32.239 --> 00:35:34.360
is to be be sent there soon.

00:35:34.959 --> 00:35:37.220
Li Chengling will accompany it.

00:35:40.040 --> 00:35:42.059
The drones can fly normally

00:35:42.059 --> 00:35:43.120
and take photos at the same time.

00:35:43.540 --> 00:35:44.239
You can take pictures

00:35:44.239 --> 00:35:45.540
of a huge area

00:35:45.540 --> 00:35:46.980
and return automatically.

00:35:47.279 --> 00:35:49.360
Or you can set a route so that it stops at certain locations

00:35:52.040 --> 00:35:54.680
to drop something to eat or drink, some fuel or supplies.

00:35:58.279 --> 00:35:58.980
The drone can

00:35:58.980 --> 00:36:01.059
also drop other things, of course.

00:36:01.720 --> 00:36:03.339
Li Chengling knows what is

00:36:03.339 --> 00:36:05.160
needed at the Ukrainian front.

00:36:05.739 --> 00:36:06.440
Because he has already been there.

00:36:07.300 --> 00:36:07.819
Just after

00:36:07.819 --> 00:36:09.620
the outbreak of war, he quit his job

00:36:09.620 --> 00:36:10.839
as an Uber driver

00:36:10.839 --> 00:36:13.099
and drove off.

00:36:14.180 --> 00:36:14.800
The former

00:36:14.800 --> 00:36:16.400
French foreign legionnaire

00:36:16.400 --> 00:36:18.319
wanted to experience something again.

00:36:19.959 --> 00:36:21.339
The irony of globalization:

00:36:22.260 --> 00:36:24.879
The Taiwanese Li flew Chinese drones

00:36:24.879 --> 00:36:26.500
on the Ukrainian front.

00:36:27.440 --> 00:36:28.580
And on his return he was

00:36:28.580 --> 00:36:30.940
immediately hired by GEOSAT.

00:36:31.860 --> 00:36:33.500
Now he will bring

00:36:33.500 --> 00:36:34.980
a donation to Ukraine.

00:36:39.419 --> 00:36:43.360
There are many young people in Taiwan,&lt;/b

00:36:43.580 --> 00:36:46.019
who went to Ukraine as international volunteers.

00:36:46.019 --> 00:36:48.599
That was very brave.

00:36:49.239 --> 00:36:50.279
The long-term

00:36:50.279 --> 00:36:51.680
development, however, is important.

00:36:52.300 --> 00:36:54.099
In other words, what can we learn

00:36:54.099 --> 00:36:55.540
from the Ukrainian battlefield?&lt;/b

00:36:56.260 --> 00:36:58.000
As far as the use of drones is concerned,&lt;/b

00:36:58.000 --> 00:36:59.519
it is a modern and

00:36:59.519 --> 00:37:00.800
necessary instrument

00:37:00.800 --> 00:37:02.620
on the battlefield, if it is

00:37:02.620 --> 00:37:03.800
successvully integrated

00:37:04.040 --> 00:37:04.699
into the existing

00:37:04.699 --> 00:37:06.239
troop units.

00:37:06.720 --> 00:37:08.440
We have to study this new

00:37:08.440 --> 00:37:09.440
technique of warfare

00:37:09.440 --> 00:37:10.839
and also introduce it in Taiwan.

00:37:14.739 --> 00:37:16.180
Charity paired

00:37:16.180 --> 00:37:17.639
with sober calculation

00:37:17.639 --> 00:37:18.839
is supposed to aid the small

00:37:18.839 --> 00:37:20.720
Asian democracy

00:37:20.980 --> 00:37:22.580
to oppose their

00:37:22.580 --> 00:37:23.919
totalitarian neighbor.

00:37:24.720 --> 00:37:25.919
In order to minimize the risk

00:37:25.919 --> 00:37:27.660
of an attack.

00:37:30.300 --> 00:37:33.480
China aims at minimizing

00:37:33.480 --> 00:37:34.739
its own risk.

00:37:36.239 --> 00:37:37.040
China sees itself in a

00:37:37.040 --> 00:37:39.019
global competition with the USA.

00:37:39.019 --> 00:37:44.980
At the center of Beijing's strategy: dominance in certain

00:37:44.980 --> 00:37:46.559
particularly valuable raw materials.

00:37:47.379 --> 00:37:49.339
Yunnan Province, Southwest China.

00:37:50.139 --> 00:37:51.500
Our goal is a mine

00:37:51.500 --> 00:37:53.099
of the company Yunnan Chihong.

00:37:53.559 --> 00:37:54.919
It delivers nearly a third of the

00:37:54.919 --> 00:37:56.980
worldwide production of Germanium.

00:37:58.139 --> 00:37:59.680
The company video is filled

00:37:59.680 --> 00:38:00.699
