More than half of its

00:38:13.120 --> 00:38:14.419
Galliums stems from China.

00:38:15.120 --> 00:38:17.300
The figure for Germanium is 82%.

00:38:19.519 --> 00:38:20.559
Since August, China has

00:38:20.559 --> 00:38:21.919
