00:38:28.260 --> 00:38:30.059
In August, exports of

00:38:30.059 --> 00:38:32.379
Germanium and Gallium from China dropped to zero.

00:38:33.839 --> 00:38:37.540
China could at any time for some products
turn off the tap and then say

00:38:37.760 --> 00:38:38.680
then you don't get any

00:38:38.680 --> 00:38:40.199
Germanium or Gallium.

00:38:40.199 --> 00:38:42.000
So far, it was just an announcement that

00:38:42.000 --> 00:38:43.300
certificates were needed.

00:38:43.300 --> 00:38:44.019
This was not a ban.

00:38:45.040 --> 00:38:47.139
You have to learn from that, you have to

00:38:47.139 --> 00:38:48.959
see what could happen.

00:38:50.000 --> 00:38:52.239
The tunnels of the mine of Yunnan

00:38:52.239 --> 00:38:53.620
go up to 2 km deep.

00:38:54.839 --> 00:38:56.160
To our interview request

00:38:56.160 --> 00:38:57.900
Chihong did not respond.

00:38:58.599 --> 00:38:59.980
At the main entrance barbed wire

00:38:59.980 --> 00:39:01.019
and a warning sign.

00:39:01.040 --> 00:39:03.959
"Strict ban on access for strange

00:39:03.959 --> 00:39:05.260
people and vehicles!"

00:39:05.980 --> 00:39:08.220
A security guard immediately confronts us.

00:39:08.900 --> 00:39:10.819
We ask again for an interview.

00:39:11.540 --> 00:39:13.540
I'll have to ask the head office, they

00:39:13.540 --> 00:39:14.599
decide whether you can get in.

00:39:15.379 --> 00:39:16.260
You are not allowed in now.

00:39:17.040 --> 00:39:20.319
The mood is tense.

00:39:20.980 --> 00:39:22.639
The security guard is visibly uncomfortable

00:39:22.639 --> 00:39:24.400
with our sudden appearance.

00:39:25.360 --> 00:39:27.279
The company doesn't want to talk to us.

00:39:28.379 --> 00:39:30.019
Rejections from government agencies, too.

00:39:30.040 --> 00:39:33.080
Only Victor Gao,

00:39:33.360 --> 00:39:35.400
Vice President of the "Center for China

00:39:35.400 --> 00:39:36.959
and Globalization" and

00:39:36.959 --> 00:39:38.339
unofficial mouthpiece

00:39:38.339 --> 00:39:39.120
of the Communist Party,

00:39:39.120 --> 00:39:41.339
agrees to do an interview.

00:39:42.779 --> 00:39:46.919
China has absolute dominance in

00:39:46.919 --> 00:39:48.419
rare earths and metals.

00:39:48.919 --> 00:39:51.180
China still has two dozen aces up its sleeve.

00:39:52.019 --> 00:39:53.720
We have no problem with Germany.

00:39:55.319 --> 00:39:56.019
But if the Federal Republic of Germany were to follow the USA

00:39:56.059 --> 00:39:59.940
with their unjustified sanctions

00:39:59.940 --> 00:40:01.080
against China,

00:40:01.500 --> 00:40:02.879
then exports to

00:40:02.879 --> 00:40:04.480
Germany will just be as regulated,

00:40:04.699 --> 00:40:06.459
like the Chinese government is already doing this

00:40:06.459 --> 00:40:07.680
as far as the rare metals Gallium

00:40:08.040 --> 00:40:10.019
and Germanium are concerned.

00:40:10.019 --> 00:40:10.699
As with antibiotics, Germany also had

00:40:10.699 --> 00:40:12.160
a Gallium production of its owny.

00:40:12.800 --> 00:40:15.239
Here in Stade, near Hamburg.

00:40:20.059 --> 00:40:32.839
But only until 2017.

00:40:34.220 --> 00:40:35.599
Gallium from Stade was

00:40:35.599 --> 00:40:36.959
not competitive.

00:40:40.620 --> 00:40:41.900
Then there is the political question,&lt;/b

00:40:42.540 --> 00:40:45.480
is the production of Gallium

00:40:45.480 --> 00:40:46.599
in Germany worth the effort?

00:40:46.940 --> 00:40:47.440
Regarding security of supply,

00:40:48.779 --> 00:40:50.080
regarding competitiveness.

00:40:50.919 --> 00:40:52.620
For the semiconductor industry

00:40:52.620 --> 00:40:54.419
this question seems to be answered.

00:40:54.419 --> 00:40:58.699
2, 1, to the future!

00:41:01.279 --> 00:41:02.919
In May 2023

00:41:03.040 --> 00:41:03.839
the EU

00:41:03.839 --> 00:41:06.419
Commission President and Chancellor

00:41:06.419 --> 00:41:07.919
