Earlier TSMC invested a lot in China.

00:42:04.080 --> 00:42:04.660
Not anymore.

00:42:05.480 --> 00:42:06.839
Because the semiconductor industry

00:42:06.839 --> 00:42:08.300
is part of the national

00:42:08.300 --> 00:42:09.440
