00:42:54.639 --> 00:43:00.599
Industrial policy, there and here.

00:43:01.559 --> 00:43:03.419
On this green meadow in Dresden

00:43:03.419 --> 00:43:05.260
in about four years, TSMC will

00:43:05.260 --> 00:43:06.019
