00:45:25.059 --> 00:45:27.139
We just need to de-risk a bit.

00:45:27.839 --> 00:45:29.260
Minimize the risk a little,

00:45:29.260 --> 00:45:30.379
Diversify a little.

00:45:30.739 --> 00:45:31.639
As if the

00:45:31.639 --> 00:45:32.639
