00:48:18.779 --> 00:48:20.319
These nets are under the

00:48:20.319 --> 00:48:21.879
control of the network operators.

00:48:22.139 --> 00:48:24.699
These scenarios of espionage and

00:48:24.699 --> 00:48:26.959
sabotage belong in the

00:48:26.959 --> 00:48:28.839
realm of Science Fiction.

00:48:30.040 --> 00:48:31.900
But the science fiction, so the

00:48:31.900 --> 00:48:33.879
fear, could become reality.

00:48:35.040 --> 00:48:36.800
Because China's
national security law,

00:48:37.040 --> 00:48:39.059
obligates companies to provide information

00:48:39.059 --> 00:48:40.459
for the Party and the state.

00:48:41.360 --> 00:48:42.580
In the USA are

00:48:42.580 --> 00:48:44.699
Huawei components have therefore long been taboo.

00:48:45.500 --> 00:48:47.620
&lt;/b

00:48:49.639 --> 00:48:51.620
.

00:48:53.040 --> 00:48:57.879
When the German government is determined

00:48:57.879 --> 00:48:59.480
to shoot its own knee, be my guest.

00:48:59.959 --> 00:49:00.980
We can't stop you.

00:49:02.059 --> 00:49:02.959
We can't stop people from

00:49:02.959 --> 00:49:05.059
doing all the stupid things

00:49:05.480 --> 00:49:07.139
which will inflict all the damage,&lt;/b

00:49:07.360 --> 00:49:09.239
injuries and losses to the German people.

00:49:09.839 --> 00:49:10.860
But I personally hope

00:49:11.120 --> 00:49:12.139
that the German government,

00:49:12.139 --> 00:49:13.599
as I have always perceived them,

00:49:13.940 --> 00:49:15.220
will be smarter and wiser.

00:49:18.800 --> 00:49:21.419
A ban of Chinese 5G technology

00:49:21.419 --> 00:49:22.739
for German network operators,

00:49:23.300 --> 00:49:25.459
it would have a signal effect for the whole of Europe.

00:49:28.059 --> 00:49:30.279
We don't want to lose any country

00:49:30.279 --> 00:49:31.379
as a customer

00:49:31.620 --> 00:49:32.800
especially not the biggest market

00:49:32.800 --> 00:49:34.519
in Europe, the German market.

00:49:35.040 --> 00:49:36.720
If you can survive an thrive

00:49:36.720 --> 00:49:38.239
on the German market,

00:49:38.459 --> 00:49:39.220
you can also do that

00:49:39.220 --> 00:49:40.360
in many other markets.

00:49:42.160 --> 00:49:44.239
The German telephone providers are also running

00:49:44.239 --> 00:49:46.239
up in arms about possible restrictions.

00:49:46.900 --> 00:49:49.040
They threaten Berlin with claims for damages.

00:49:49.599 --> 00:49:51.199
Despite all the safety concerns.

00:49:52.180 --> 00:49:54.099
Like the car companies, they want to carry on

00:49:54.099 --> 00:49:56.019
with China as before.

00:49:57.000 --> 00:49:59.000
The pressure on politicians is enormous.

00:49:59.680 --> 00:50:00.279
I myself have

00:50:00.279 --> 00:50:01.300
always made very clear

00:50:01.300 --> 00:50:03.360
that risk minimization also includes&lt;/b

00:50:03.360 --> 00:50:06.339
that we have no technology from China here

00:50:06.339 --> 00:50:08.419
in our infrastructure,

00:50:08.419 --> 00:50:09.599
with which we are vulnerable.

00:50:09.800 --> 00:50:10.839
And I think we have to

00:50:10.839 --> 00:50:12.059
be self-confident enough

00:50:12.059 --> 00:50:12.919
and say we won't let

00:50:12.919 --> 00:50:14.059
anyone put us under pressure.

00:50:18.699 --> 00:50:19.440
Obviously after all.

00:50:20.160 --> 00:50:22.139
Germany tries a compromise

00:50:22.660 --> 00:50:24.019
De-risking light, so to speak.

00:50:24.059 --> 00:50:26.879
For now, only be a small but

00:50:26.879 --> 00:50:28.040
significant part of the

00:50:28.040 --> 00:50:29.480
Huawei technology is banned

00:50:29.480 --> 00:50:32.319
and more transparency demanded from China.

00:50:33.540 --> 00:50:35.300
But even on our hour-long

00:50:35.300 --> 00:50:37.699
visit to the Huawei's Europe

00:50:37.699 --> 00:50:41.279
we have only seen the facades of.

00:50:41.279 --> 00:50:42.419
China's megatech firm.

00:50:48.000 --> 00:50:50.180
In Taiwan, people are happy about anything that

00:50:50.180 --> 00:50:52.019
hints a growing distance to China.

00:50:53.040 --> 00:50:55.040
It gives them hope that Germany would,

00:50:55.040 --> 00:50:56.599
in the event of a conflict,

00:50:56.779 --> 00:50:58.239
consistently be on the side of the

00:50:58.239 --> 00:51:00.339
democratic Taiwan.

00:51:01.180 --> 00:51:05.720
We would like to see

00:51:05.720 --> 00:51:06.959
that Germany is ready

00:51:07.519 --> 00:51:08.440
to use their warships

00:51:08.440 --> 00:51:10.580
in the Asia-Pacific region

00:51:13.040 --> 00:51:14.699
and to hold military drills

00:51:14.699 --> 00:51:16.599
in the Indo-Pacific region .

00:51:18.339 --> 00:51:20.300
But who knows if the international

00:51:20.300 --> 00:51:21.599
help is coming after all?

00:51:22.319 --> 00:51:24.779
For peace in the Taiwan Strait

00:51:24.779 --> 00:51:25.959
it is very important

00:51:25.959 --> 00:51:28.019
that the Taiwanese political leadership

00:51:28.019 --> 00:51:29.519
convince Beijing

00:51:29.879 --> 00:51:30.559
that they can

00:51:30.559 --> 00:51:32.180
withstand an attack.

00:51:32.559 --> 00:51:34.180
Because if the impression arises that the

00:51:34.180 --> 00:51:35.379
Taiwanese society

00:51:35.379 --> 00:51:36.940
will capitulate very quickly,

00:51:37.360 --> 00:51:38.919
the probability of an attack

00:51:38.919 --> 00:51:40.379
increases very strongly.

00:51:42.139 --> 00:51:43.699
They don't trust in this.

00:51:44.059 --> 00:51:45.900
They meet once a week with

00:51:45.900 --> 00:51:47.260
military discipline

00:51:47.260 --> 00:51:48.620
at the open-air stage

00:51:48.620 --> 00:51:50.959
of Da'an Park in Taipei.

00:51:54.040 --> 00:51:56.260
What we hope is that we will

00:51:56.260 --> 00:51:57.260
be able to demonstrate our

00:51:57.260 --> 00:51:57.940
determination to fight back.

00:51:58.639 --> 00:51:59.919
We cannot expect from other countries

00:51:59.919 --> 00:52:01.080
to help us,

00:52:01.559 --> 00:52:02.739
if we do not show the will

00:52:02.739 --> 00:52:03.959
to do so.

00:52:07.120 --> 00:52:10.319
So they, decidedly and somewhat touching,

00:52:10.319 --> 00:52:12.040
practice close combat.

00:52:14.279 --> 00:52:15.519
They forgot the

00:52:15.519 --> 00:52:16.419
wooden rifles today.

00:52:17.180 --> 00:52:18.720
But that doesn't stop their enthusiasm.

00:52:20.040 --> 00:52:21.639
Self-defense groups like this one now

00:52:21.639 --> 00:52:23.199
exist all over the country.

00:52:23.660 --> 00:52:25.580
The young Taiwanese in particular feel

00:52:25.580 --> 00:52:27.500
no ties to the People's Republic

00:52:27.500 --> 00:52:28.480
and want to be

00:52:28.480 --> 00:52:30.180
prepared for the worst case scenario.

00:52:33.540 --> 00:52:35.300
Once the catastrophe is here,&lt;/b

00:52:35.540 --> 00:52:36.779
we will all be nervous

00:52:36.779 --> 00:52:37.680
and perhaps forget

00:52:37.680 --> 00:52:39.559
what we already knew before.

00:52:42.059 --> 00:52:44.199
But through constant practicing the

00:52:44.199 --> 00:52:45.800
movement becomes a muscle memory

00:52:45.800 --> 00:52:48.160
and then we can

00:52:48.160 --> 00:52:49.080
make decisions

00:52:49.680 --> 00:52:51.459
which might rescue our own lives

00:52:51.459 --> 00:52:52.839
and perhaps even that of

00:52:52.839 --> 00:52:53.660
our family members.

00:52:56.040 --> 00:52:59.900
Today Chuang Yuwei is their star guest.

00:53:00.959 --> 00:53:02.940
The man who fought in Ukraine

00:53:02.940 --> 00:53:04.260
last year

00:53:04.760 --> 00:53:07.019
is now bravely taking part in weight training.

00:53:07.059 --> 00:53:10.419
But actually he came,

00:53:10.660 --> 00:53:11.800
to demonstrate his Ukrainian

00:53:11.800 --> 00:53:13.660
first aid set.

00:53:15.400 --> 00:53:16.699
Yes, that's a bandage.

00:53:17.580 --> 00:53:21.000
Yes, yes, if you have one hole

00:53:21.000 --> 00:53:22.860
in the front and one in the back.

00:53:24.360 --> 00:53:26.279
His listeners are spellbound.

00:53:26.800 --> 00:53:29.059
What they train for appears much closer

00:53:29.059 --> 00:53:30.279
through his words.

00:53:31.980 --> 00:53:34.019
He really went to Ukraine

00:53:34.040 --> 00:53:37.059
and returned alive.

00:53:37.059 --> 00:53:38.860
That's very admirable.

00:53:39.839 --> 00:53:41.000
I have seen the things he brought

00:53:41.000 --> 00:53:42.660
along today before.

00:53:43.220 --> 00:53:43.980
But today I have

00:53:43.980 --> 00:53:45.279
got it for the first time,

00:53:45.519 --> 00:53:46.360
that they were really

00:53:46.360 --> 00:53:47.860
used in a war.

00:53:52.040 --> 00:53:54.819
At the end of a long training evening

00:53:55.040 --> 00:53:57.680
the hero is emotionally agitated.

00:53:59.559 --> 00:54:02.040
What he sings is the anthem of Ukraine.

00:54:32.819 --> 00:54:34.300
Whether China is really going to

00:54:34.300 --> 00:54:36.180
attack Taiwan, we don't know.

00:54:36.699 --> 00:54:37.660
But Taiwan tries

00:54:37.660 --> 00:54:39.120
to prepare for it.

00:54:39.919 --> 00:54:40.480
And Germany?

00:54:41.139 --> 00:54:42.779
What we need to do in Germany

00:54:43.160 --> 00:54:45.080
is to become more independent

00:54:45.080 --> 00:54:46.300
and that we also position us self-confidently

00:54:46.300 --> 00:54:47.339
against China.

00:54:48.019 --> 00:54:49.500
And I think that helps in the end, too.

00:54:49.500 --> 00:54:49.940
for a better

00:54:49.940 --> 00:54:51.000
relationship with China.

00:54:51.440 --> 00:54:53.699
To be less dependent, less vulnerable

00:54:53.699 --> 00:54:55.019
is going to be expensive.

00:54:55.040 --> 00:54:56.080
We have to be able to provide

00:54:56.080 --> 00:54:58.720
the basic care

00:54:58.720 --> 00:55:01.019
for our population.

00:55:01.019 --> 00:55:01.800
We certainly also have

00:55:01.800 --> 00:55:03.559
to diversify widely,

00:55:04.040 --> 00:55:06.440
that we do not have to accept such

00:55:06.440 --> 00:55:08.360
country risks politically.

00:55:09.019 --> 00:55:10.220
But Germany is not

00:55:10.220 --> 00:55:11.419
at China's mercy.

00:55:12.819 --> 00:55:14.279
China needs Europe, too.

00:55:15.000 --> 00:55:18.339
We are dependent on some products.

00:55:19.519 --> 00:55:21.019
But China also needs the European market.

00:55:21.040 --> 00:55:22.900
And China also needs

00:55:22.900 --> 00:55:24.540
imports from Europe.

00:55:26.639 --> 00:55:28.319
In Berlin, Anton and his

00:55:28.319 --> 00:55:30.139
father are at the doctor's once again.

00:55:31.760 --> 00:55:32.199
 

00:55:32.199 --> 00:55:33.680
 

00:55:34.099 --> 00:55:36.360
The therapy in the

00:55:36.360 --> 00:55:38.180
hospital has helped Anton.

00:55:40.980 --> 00:55:42.480
His lungs are healthy again.

00:55:46.040 --> 00:55:47.779
I'm so glad this

00:55:47.779 --> 00:55:51.919
did not end a different way.
I'm very happy that it didn't turn out differently. But you don't want to

00:55:51.919 --> 00:55:53.019
get into a situation like this again.

00:55:53.660 --> 00:55:54.900
Then you get frustrated

00:55:54.900 --> 00:55:56.040
and angry.

00:55:56.480 --> 00:55:58.300
That it even comes to this.

00:55:58.959 --> 00:55:59.739
Do you still remember

00:55:59.739 --> 00:56:00.860
what it was like for you

00:56:00.860 --> 00:56:02.059
to go to the hospital?

00:56:03.040 --> 00:56:06.080
Yes, even once during the night.

00:56:07.739 --> 00:56:09.680
Then I actually did not want

00:56:09.680 --> 00:56:11.239
to go to the hospital.

00:56:12.400 --> 00:56:13.099
How are you today?

00:56:13.879 --> 00:56:14.379
Good.

00:56:15.040 --> 00:56:18.019
For Anton, things went

00:56:18.019 --> 00:56:19.180
off without a hitch.

00:56:23.040 --> 00:56:24.019
Malik Böttcher now collects

00:56:24.019 --> 00:56:25.139
medications which are

00:56:25.139 --> 00:56:26.500
not quite used up and which

00:56:26.500 --> 00:56:28.519
his patients gave to him.

00:56:29.360 --> 00:56:30.080
Perhaps he has

00:56:30.080 --> 00:56:31.319
something in the drawer,

00:56:31.319 --> 00:56:32.519
when things get tight again.

00:56:32.919 --> 00:56:33.540
This is

00:56:33.540 --> 00:56:34.599
born out of necessity.

00:56:35.099 --> 00:56:36.540
Theoretically, we are not allowed to do that.

00:56:36.540 --> 00:56:37.580
But we just do it anyway.

00:56:40.040 --> 00:56:42.000
Because there are currently many situations where patients

00:56:42.000 --> 00:56:43.260
cannot start their therapy on the day.

00:56:43.599 --> 00:56:45.940
Because they have to wait 2-3 days until the

00:56:45.940 --> 00:56:46.720
medication is available.

00:56:47.080 --> 00:56:50.739
You often notice your own blackmailability

00:56:50.739 --> 00:56:51.379
only when things

00:56:51.379 --> 00:56:52.519
happen, as with Anton.

00:56:53.379 --> 00:56:55.040
When a confusing,

00:56:55.040 --> 00:56:56.760
disturbing world intervenes,

00:56:57.279 --> 00:56:58.739
in the life of a six-year-old.

00:57:01.040 --> 00:57:02.360
But dependence is

00:57:02.360 --> 00:57:03.739
nothing fated.

00:57:04.239 --> 00:57:04.959
It is made.

00:57:05.959 --> 00:57:07.180
And that's why it can

00:57:07.180 --> 00:57:08.019
be reduced again.

00:57:08.059 --> 00:57:10.319
If you want to.

